    "Description": "Expat is a C library for parsing XML documents.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* expat: libexpat: Use-after-free vulnerability due to improper handler call depth tracking (CVE-2026-50219)\n\n* expat: libexpat: Arbitrary Code Execution via Heap-based Buffer Overflow (CVE-2026-56132)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
